  "description": "Young, wealthy, and extremely suspicious—from the moment he set foot in the quiet naval city, Jin Haerok had people groveling at his feet left and right. Lieutenant Seon Yulhui, however, has standards. Some might call her a model policewoman, while others would say that she’s a rigid stickler for the rules. So when he waltzes into her life just to flirt with her, every instinct tells Yulhui to stay away from that man. But what happens when she is left with no choice but to walk right into his bed in order to save a fellow policeman?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
